Subject: [PATCH] ci(js-tests): check E2E drivers under the runtime-only
 tests-js install; run tests-js on tests/install and scripts/sandbox changes
 [daveey]

---
 .../scripts/check-runtime-driver-imports.mjs  | 161 ++++++++++++++++++
 .github/workflows/js-tests.yml                |  31 ++++
 scripts/ci/classify_changes.py                |   7 +-
 tests/ci/test_runtime_install_shape.py        | 114 +++++++++++++
